  "definition": "Lindane Classification",
  "effectiveDate": "2024-08-22",
  "historyNote": "#5590, eff 2-25-93 (From Pes 701.05); amd by #6160, eff 1-3-96; ss by #6316, eff 8-13-96; ss by #7987, eff 1-3-04, EXPIRED: 1-3-12 New. #10489, INTERIM, eff 12-17-13, EXPIRED: 6-16-14 New. #10712, eff 11-5-14; ss by #14064, eff 8-22-24",
